koz Parsing : function declarations finkoz

zafer addition(a, b)
ouver
    ran a èk b
fèrm

koz error : expected function name finkoz
zafer (a, b)
ouver
    ran a
fèrm

koz error : expected '(' after function name finkoz
fonksyon salu
ouver
    afise("alo")
fèrm

koz error : expected parameter name, a number is not a name finkoz
travay karé(5)
ouver
    ran 5 fwa 5
fèrm

koz error : expected parameter name, nothing follows the comma finkoz
zafer mwayen(a, b,)
ouver
    ran (a èk b) koup 2
fèrm

koz error : expected ')' after parameters, the comma is missing finkoz
zafer diferans(a b)
ouver
    ran a mwin b
fèrm

koz error : expected start of block, the body is not in a scope finkoz
zafer triple(n) ran n fwa 3

koz error : expected start of block, there is no body finkoz
zafer vid()
afise("pa de kor")

koz error : expected end of block, the scope is never closed finkoz
